Package: stationconnect-client
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: StationConnect Engineering <engineering@stationconnect.invalid>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, @DEPENDS@
Description: StationConnect remote workstation client
 Dedicated Moonlight-based client for authenticated StationConnect sessions.
 The package carries its qualified FFmpeg runtime privately and leaves the
 Ubuntu system FFmpeg installation unchanged.
